        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Calm the storm within.</strong> Inspired by mindfulness technique and old-school tower defense, this unique blend of puzzle game helps you visualize  anxious thoughts. Instead of being overwhelmed, you'll focus on a single thought, bring it into your mental space, and simply Maze It Out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >­­­            <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899320/extras/e4361e3475d469f489aff228a1906a25.poster.avif?t=1763322665\" width=620 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899320/extras/e4361e3475d469f489aff228a1906a25.webm?t=1763322665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899320/extras/e4361e3475d469f489aff228a1906a25.mp4?t=1763322665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Focus your mind:</strong> Build intricate mazes using various blockers to force the Dark Whisper along the longest path, preventing it from reaching your heart. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore over 100 puzzles:</strong> Journey through a smooth difficulty curve, starting with a relaxing campaign and progressing to challenging trials for puzzle veterans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unleash your creativity:</strong> Share your own maze designs using the sandbox map editor!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-drawn visual and original music:</strong> That we hope you will find charming ^^. <br><br>­         <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899320/extras/9890e016f983f0fa604879e94d5c0bb1.poster.avif?t=1763322665\" width=620 height=106 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899320/extras/9890e016f983f0fa604879e94d5c0bb1.webm?t=1763322665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899320/extras/9890e016f983f0fa604879e94d5c0bb1.mp4?t=1763322665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Calm the storm within.</strong> Inspired by mindfulness technique and old-school tower defense, this unique blend of puzzle game helps you visualize  anxious thoughts. Instead of being overwhelmed, you'll focus on a single thought, bring it into your mental space, and simply Maze It Out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >­­­            <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899320/extras/e4361e3475d469f489aff228a1906a25.poster.avif?t=1763322665\" width=620 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899320/extras/e4361e3475d469f489aff228a1906a25.webm?t=1763322665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899320/extras/e4361e3475d469f489aff228a1906a25.mp4?t=1763322665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Focus your mind:</strong> Build intricate mazes using various blockers to force the Dark Whisper along the longest path, preventing it from reaching your heart. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore over 100 puzzles:</strong> Journey through a smooth difficulty curve, starting with a relaxing campaign and progressing to challenging trials for puzzle veterans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unleash your creativity:</strong> Share your own maze designs using the sandbox map editor!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-drawn visual and original music:</strong> That we hope you will find charming ^^. <br><br>­         <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899320/extras/9890e016f983f0fa604879e94d5c0bb1.poster.avif?t=1763322665\" width=620 height=106 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899320/extras/9890e016f983f0fa604879e94d5c0bb1.webm?t=1763322665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899320/extras/9890e016f983f0fa604879e94d5c0bb1.mp4?t=1763322665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
